        "description": "<p>When the @Lookup[@name] deals damage, the target must succeed on a Strength Reaction Roll or become <em>Vulnerable</em>. If the target is already <em>Vulnerable</em>, they become <em>Restrained</em>. If the target is already <em>Vulnerable</em> and <em>Restrained</em>, they must make a death move. The PC can <strong>spend a Hope</strong> per condition to clear it.</p>",
